# Try the API from VS Code (REST Client) or Visual Studio / Rider.
@api = http://localhost:5080

### Public config
GET {{api}}/api/config

### Menu (available items only)
GET {{api}}/api/menu

### Sign in as admin — copy "token" from the response into @token
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@joyspizza.local", "password": "admin123" }

###
@token = paste-token-here

### Menu including unavailable items (admin)
GET {{api}}/api/menu?includeUnavailable=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a menu item (admin)
POST {{api}}/api/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hawaiian Pizza",
  "description": "Ham, pineapple, mozzarella and tomato sauce.",
  "price": 14.99,
  "category": "Pizza",
  "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565299624946-b28f40a0ae38?w=800",
  "tags": ["New"],
  "special": false,
  "sizes": [
    { "label": "Small 10\"", "price": 14.99 },
    { "label": "Large 16\"", "price": 22.99 }
  ],
  "available": true
}

### Mark an item unavailable (hidden from the website)
PATCH {{api}}/api/menu/pz-pepperoni/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "available": false }

### Place an order (as any signed-in user)
POST {{api}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "menuItemId": "pz-margherita", "size": "Large 16\"", "quantity": 1 },
    { "menuItemId": "dr-soda", "quantity": 2 }
  ],
  "fulfillment": "delivery",
  "customerName": "Jamie Rivera",
  "email": "jamie@example.com",
  "phone": "(917) 555-0199",
  "address": "12 Bank St, New York, NY 10014",
  "tipPercent": 0.18
}

### Kitchen dashboard (admin)
GET {{api}}/api/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Advance an order (admin)
PATCH {{api}}/api/admin/orders/ORD-XXXXXXXX/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Preparing" }
